      <li>Upgrade installed Operators</li>
      <li>Delete installed Operators</li>
      <li>Configure proxy support</li>
      <li>Using Operator Lifecycle Manager in disconnected environments</li>
      </ul>
      <p>For information about the cluster Operators that Red Hat provides, see "Cluster Operators reference".</p>
